&lt;p&gt;The estimated hourly pay-rate is $24 - $26 per hour, depending on experience. &lt;strong&gt;At this time and in the future, GenScript will not sponsor or support employment authorization for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
