&lt;li&gt;Paid Sick Days (earned based on hours worked)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compassionate Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jury Duty Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Float day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free colleague meals during shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite massages Charis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite gyms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Salary range: $100,000 – $120,000 total compensation, including bonus, depending on experience and qualifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &#39;Untitled Sans&#39;, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Benefits:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
