&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lean Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding and practical application of Lean manufacturing principles applied directly to daily shop-floor production operations.&lt;/p&gt;
