&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills with the ability to manage up to factory leaders and support hands-on floor personnel effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
