&lt;p data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2143&quot;&gt;Gene synthesis and molecular biology services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2146&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;Protein, antibody, and reagent solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2189&quot; data-end=&quot;2280&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2191&quot; data-end=&quot;2280&quot;&gt;Biologics CDMO services (cell line development, process development, GMP manufacturing)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2281&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2283&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;Cell and gene therapy solutions&lt;/p&gt;
