&lt;li&gt;Experience with contract development and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; cost-driven decision maker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor younger buyers/ planners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
